  (text
    "USB\nJ5 -> U6 (USB1) is routed to TI's guidelines with D9/D10 TPD1E05U06 (0.42 pF) at the connector: si PASS.\nJ6 -> U7 (USB2) has D12/D13 TVS0500 surge diodes (155 pF) on stubs and TP1 on another stub, and is routed\nnarrow with uneven vias: si FAIL (impedance, skew, vias, stubs, capacitance, eye).\nD11 TVS0500 on VBUS2: tvs-standoff FAIL (warning): 5 V stand-off under the 5.25 V VBUS can reach.\nVBUS can't be plugged in backwards (USB-C), so inputs.toml skips its reversed case."
    (at 20 20 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "f82470d7-2516-5f13-ad4c-87066bf9768f"))
